commodity $1000.00
P 2020-12-01 $ 76.20
P 2021-01-01 $ 73.88

2020-12-02 invest
 assets:investment  10000
 assets

2021-01-02 get profit
 assets:investment  =11000
 income:investment

$ hledger -f - roi --inv assets:investment --pnl income:investment --value=end,'$'
