# ** 13. Several PnL transactions on a single date are aggregated together
<
2010-01-01   A1
    savingA                      100.00 €
    checking   

2011-12-31   A2
    savingA                        0.00 €
    dividendA                     -8.00 €
    checking
    
2012-03-29   A3
    savingA                     -100.00 €
    checking
    
# ========================================

2010-01-01   B1
    savingB                      100.00 €
    checking   

2011-12-31   B2
    savingB                        0.00 €
    dividendB                     -8.00 €
    checking
    
2012-03-29   B3
    saving                      -100.00 €
    checking
$ hledger -f - roi --inv saving --pnl dividend
+---++------------+------------++---------------+----------+-------------+---------++-------++------------+----------+
|   ||      Begin |        End || Value (begin) | Cashflow | Value (end) |     PnL ||   IRR || TWR/period | TWR/year |
+===++============+============++===============+==========+=============+=========++=======++============+==========+
| 1 || 2010-01-01 | 2012-03-29 ||             0 | -16.00 € |           0 | 16.00 € || 3.53% ||      8.00% |    3.49% |
+---++------------+------------++---------------+----------+-------------+---------++-------++------------+----------+

