# ** 22. Prices on the conversion path value the investment, prices of unrelated commodities don't
<
P 2024-01-01 F 10 EUR
P 2024-01-01 EUR $1.10
P 2024-02-01 EUR $1.10
P 2024-03-01 GBP $1.30
P 2024-04-01 EUR $1.20
P 2024-05-01 EUR $1.25

2024-01-01 buy
    investment    100 F
    assets:cash   $-1100
2024-02-15 buy
    investment    100 F
    assets:cash   $-1100
2024-03-15 sell
    investment    -50 F
    assets:cash   $600

$ hledger -f - roi --inv investment --value=then,$ -b 2024-01 -e 2024-05-02 --cashflow

IRR cash flows for 2024-01-01 - 2024-05-01
+------------++--------------------------------+---------------------+-------------+-----------+
|            ||                    Description | Investment, at cost | Profit/loss |    Amount |
+============++================================+=====================+=============+===========+
| 2024-01-01 ||                            buy |            $1100.00 |           0 | $-1100.00 |
| 2024-02-15 ||                            buy |            $1100.00 |           0 | $-1100.00 |
| 2024-03-15 ||                           sell |            $-600.00 |           0 |   $600.00 |
| 2024-05-02 || value at the end of 2024-05-01 |                     |             |  $1875.00 |
+------------++--------------------------------+---------------------+-------------+-----------+
Amounts are from your point of view: what you put in is negative, what you take out (or still have) positive.


TWR returns for period 2024-01-01 - 2024-05-01
+---++------------+------------+---------------++---------------+----------+-------------+-------------++-----------+---------------+
|   ||      Begin |        End |          Part || Value (begin) | Deposits | Withdrawals | Value (end) || Return, % | Cumulative, % |
+===++============+============+===============++===============+==========+=============+=============++===========+===============+
| 1 || 2024-01-01 | 2024-01-01 |    cash flows ||             0 | $1100.00 |           0 |    $1100.00 ||      0.00 |          0.00 |
| 2 || 2024-01-02 | 2024-02-14 | no cash flows ||      $1100.00 |        0 |           0 |    $1100.00 ||      0.00 |          0.00 |
| 3 || 2024-02-15 | 2024-02-15 |    cash flows ||      $1100.00 | $1100.00 |           0 |    $2200.00 ||      0.00 |          0.00 |
| 4 || 2024-02-16 | 2024-03-14 | no cash flows ||      $2200.00 |        0 |           0 |    $2200.00 ||      0.00 |          0.00 |
| 5 || 2024-03-15 | 2024-03-15 |    cash flows ||      $2200.00 |        0 |    $-600.00 |    $1650.00 ||      2.27 |          2.27 |
