# ** 41. With several trades on a day, a holding with no market price is valued at the last one's price
<
2024-01-10 buy
    investment    10 F @ $100
    assets:cash
2024-01-20 buy more
    investment    10 F @ $110
    assets:cash
2024-01-20 buy more again
    investment    10 F @ $120
    assets:cash
2024-02-10 deposit cash
    investment    $10
    assets:cash
P 2024-03-31 F $130

$ hledger -f - roi --inv investment --value=then,$ -b 2024-01 -e 2024-04 --cashflow

